1
00:00:00,872 --> 00:00:04,162
(Sheldon:)Because I've come to learn
that such inquiries are inappropriate.

2
00:00:04,917 --> 00:00:09,877
(Penny:)No, I meant has he ever been involved
with someone who wasn't a brainiac?

3
00:00:10,048 --> 00:00:12,258
Oh! Well, a few years ago...

4
00:00:12,425 --> 00:00:16,475
(Sheldon:)...he did go out with a woman
who had a Ph.D. in French literature.

5
00:00:17,263 --> 00:00:21,973
- How is that not a brainiac?
- Well, for one thing, she was French.

6
00:00:23,978 --> 00:00:26,608
(Sheldon:)For another, it was literature.

7
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:34,030
(Leonard:)So...

8
00:00:35,323 --> 00:00:37,613
(Penny:)Do you think that if Leonard
and I keep dating...

9
00:00:37,784 --> 00:00:40,204
...he'll eventually get bored with me?

10
00:00:46,167 --> 00:00:48,167
- That depends.
- On what?

11
00:00:48,795 --> 00:00:51,255
(Sheldon:)Do you have a working knowledge
of quantum physics?

12
00:00:51,422 --> 00:00:52,672
(Leonard:)No.

13
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,840
(Sheldon:)Do you speak Klingon?

14
00:00:55,385 --> 00:00:56,425
(Leonard:)No.

15
00:00:56,803 --> 00:01:01,023
(Sheldon:)- You know any card tricks?
- Okay.

